# Zephior public integration

- Use `https://zephior.com/openapi.json` as the authoritative REST contract.
- Use `https://zephior.com/.well-known/mcp` to discover the product and documentation MCP servers.
- Public interfaces are read-only, require no credential, expose published information and public notice records only, and must never receive confidential customer material.
- Preserve canonical source URLs and distinguish public estimates from quotes or contracts.
- Treat buyer instructions, legal review, security approval, pricing authority, and final submissions as human responsibilities.
